WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.747
At Manulife, we're on a mission

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:04.187
to make decisions easier
and lives better

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.147
for our customers

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.187
and colleagues.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.270
I love the culture
at Manulife.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.310
I feel like people
are very welcoming.

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:11.790
I feel very supported by the team.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:12.907
Anytime I have a question,

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.427
I can ask
the person sitting next

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:15.470
to me.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.147
I was drawn to Manulife 10 years ago

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.507
because of the impact
that the organization was

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:21.947
having on people and planet.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:24.480
The

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.080
opportunity for better
is all around us.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.600
It's what drives us
and gives us purpose.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.947
Better inspires us to support colleagues

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.867
and help customers live longer,
healthier lives.

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:40.547
And by providing products and services

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:41.947
that make financial decisions

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:43.507
easier for our customers,

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:45.707
we're helping improve
their financial health.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:46.910
I mean, how great

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:47.190
is it

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:51.787
that our health efforts
help millions of people,

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.870
millions around the world,

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:55.187
have better

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:55.907
lives?

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:01.230
Joining us means you'll be empowered
to learn and grow your career,

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:02.867
have the ability

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.587
to drive positive change,

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.840
and make a global impact.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:10.640
As part of our global team,
we'll support you at every turn.

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:15.230
And you'll discover that better
can take you anywhere you want to go.

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.347
Our mission of making decisions easier
and lives better

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:21.027
isn't just a business slogan,

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:23.147
it's a personal ambition.

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:26.870
At Manulife,
we are building better together.

